# Talk inside a group at a camp (heard in /say near you when you group with bots).
# New writing (see docs/bot-voices).
# 0.36-se.4: kind "group" (was ambient, so bot groups said "pull?" and "rez pls" in /faction).

@kind group
@topic group
@who *
@needs in_group,!in_capital
@invites ask
pull?
@invites
ready when you are
@invites none
need a sec, sitting for power
med break
@needs in_group,!in_capital
buffs dropping soon
@invites
clean pull, ty
sorry, my fault
gj all
good group tonight
@invites none
brb, door
back
@invites
loot is yours, i dont need it
anyone need this drop?
@invites ask
roll for it?
@invites
grats on the drop
@invites none
one more pull then i need a break
@needs in_group,at_camp
@invites
camp bonus is nice here
xp is great tonight
half a bubble per kill, love it
@needs in_group,!in_capital
who is main assist?
@needs in_group,in_dungeon
@invites none
stick on me, moving to the next room
regroup at the entrance
@needs in_group,!in_capital
everyone here? pulling in 5
@invites
@who Socialite
@needs in_group,in_player_group
best group i have had all week honestly
anyone want to stay in touch after this?
@needs in_group,!in_capital
@who Daredevil
@invites boast
pull two, we can take it
@needs in_group,in_dungeon
@invites
lets try the room past the corner, i think we can do it
@needs in_group,!in_capital
@who Leveler
@needs in_group,at_camp
keep the pulls coming, xp is great
@needs in_group,!in_capital
no breaks, we are on a roll
@who NoLifer
@needs in_group,at_camp
@invites joke
pull faster, the respawn is waiting for us
@needs in_group,!in_capital
@invites
@who Explorer
@needs in_group,in_dungeon
anyone know what is past this room?

# Said in the middle of a fight, by a bot in the player's group, at the moment its topic names (the talking update:
# AutonomousBotGroupChatter.TryCombatCall picks the topic from what is happening in the fight).
@kind combat
@who *
@needs in_player_group,!in_capital
@topic pull
inc
pulling
careful, that one is orange
assisting you
@topic add
inc, two of them
add!
that one had friends
watch the pat
pat coming from the left
@needs in_player_group,!in_capital,is_tank
i got the adds
@needs in_player_group,!in_capital
@topic low_hp
hp low, careful on the next one
@topic rest
rebuffing, hold the pull
@topic kill
nice pull
@topic wipe
wipe incoming, run!
run run run
@topic mez
@needs in_player_group,!in_capital,is_support
mez is on the caster
@topic mez_broke
mez broke!
@needs in_player_group,!in_capital
@topic root
root is on, kill the other one
kite it, kite it
@topic stun
stun up, go
@topic taunt
@needs in_player_group,!in_capital,is_tank
taunting, get it off the healer
i have aggro, keep healing me
@needs in_player_group,!in_capital
@topic healer_oom
@needs in_player_group,!in_capital,!is_healer
healer is oom, wait
@needs in_player_group,!in_capital
@topic pull
@class Cabalist,Theurgist,Necromancer,Spiritmaster,Bonedancer,Hunter,Druid,Enchanter,Animist
pet has aggro, all good
@class
@topic heal_big
@needs in_player_group,!in_capital,is_healer
group heal coming

# The talking update audit: only a power user goes oom
@kind group
@topic group
@who *
@realm *
@class Wizard,Theurgist,Sorcerer,Cabalist,Necromancer,Cleric,Friar,Minstrel,Healer,Shaman,Runemaster,Spiritmaster,Bonedancer,Skald,Eldritch,Enchanter,Mentalist,Animist,Druid,Bard,Warden
@levels 1-50
@needs in_group,!in_capital
@invites none
oom, give me a minute

# The talking update audit: a bot offering power is one that can give it
@kind group
@topic group
@who *
@realm *
@class Cabalist,Necromancer,Spiritmaster,Bonedancer,Mentalist,Theurgist
@levels 1-50
@needs in_group,!in_capital
@invites ask_anyone
anyone need power?
